+The current Panda AI OS factory firmware configures the same bus at **20 MHz**
+and reads a card-detect input on GPIO21 that the CrossPoint port does not use.
+Its boot log also prints all six interface pins and the `gpio_set_level(10, 0)`
+power-gate call verbatim, independently confirming the probe results above —
+see [panda_ai_os.md](panda_ai_os.md).
