+## Environment Sensors
+
+Not probed on hardware. The factory firmware carries driver paths for three
+temperature/humidity parts and takes whichever answers on the I2C bus: `AHT30`,
+`AHT20` (probed at `0x38`, the address the M3's AHT30 uses) and `SHT40` (probed
+at `0x44` / `0x45`). Which part an M4 actually carries is not decidable from the
+binary. Details in [panda_ai_os.md](panda_ai_os.md).
+
+---
+
 ## WiFi / Bluetooth
 
 Built into the ESP32-S3. The factory firmware uses WiFi for OTA updates
